WEBVTT

00:12:29.621 --> 00:12:33.537
never experience the disappointment
that comes with failure.

00:12:35.621 --> 00:12:39.079
Tough emotions are part of
our contract with life.

00:12:40.329 --> 00:12:45.579
You don't get to have a meaningful career
or raise a family or leave the world

00:12:45.579 --> 00:12:49.412
a better place without stress
and discomfort.

00:12:50.579 --> 00:12:55.371
Discomfort is the price of admission
to a meaningful life.

00:12:57.996 --> 00:13:02.537
So how do we begin to dismantle rigidity
and embrace emotional agility?